1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,495
Who lives on the farm? Can you guess this shadow?

2
00:00:03,895 --> 00:00:05,844
It says moo, and it gives us milk!

3
00:00:09,644 --> 00:00:10,890
Yes! It's a cow!

4
00:00:11,390 --> 00:00:12,726
Say it with me! Cow!

5
00:00:16,026 --> 00:00:17,090
Who is this shadow?

6
00:00:17,490 --> 00:00:20,189
It has a round nose and loves to play in the mud!

7
00:00:23,989 --> 00:00:25,215
Yes! It's a pig!

8
00:00:25,715 --> 00:00:27,135
Say it with me! Pig!

9
00:00:30,435 --> 00:00:31,498
Who is this shadow?

10
00:00:31,898 --> 00:00:34,131
It has soft, fluffy wool and says baa!

11
00:00:37,931 --> 00:00:39,139
Yes! It's a sheep!

12
00:00:39,639 --> 00:00:41,045
Say it with me! Sheep!

13
00:00:44,345 --> 00:00:46,095
Last one! Who is this shadow?

14
00:00:46,495 --> 00:00:48,892
It runs very fast and goes clip clop!

15
00:00:52,692 --> 00:00:53,973
Yes! It's a horse!

16
00:00:54,473 --> 00:00:55,928
Say it with me! Horse!

17
00:00:58,928 --> 00:01:01,424
Wow! You got them all! How many did you guess?

